<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Serving in the priesthood, reigning in the kingship.</l><l>We enjoy the double portion of the land;</l><l>Christ, the serving priest and ruling One within us.</l><l>Keeps us in the oneness, our eternal stand!</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Exercise your spirit in the royal priesthood</l><l>And the resurrection power will engage;</l><l>By cooperating we are now securing</l><l>Out participating in the kingdom age.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
